/**
 * Overworld data initialisation — ported from `Overworld_init_data.gml`, `Overworld_init_data_biome.gml`,
 * `Overworld_init_data_encounter1.gml`, `Overworld_init_data_2.gml` (the pasted "pre-baked" code: only
 * the part the `OverworldData01` cache does not carry — the boulder-circle constants — plus the cache
 * loads) and `Overworld_init_data_anarkhya.gml`.
 *
 * Method 3 (the shipped one) reads `OverworldData01.txt`; here the same data comes decoded from
 * `world.caches` (`_Map0` → `dm`, the `dg_*` grids). The 380 `g.dm_rm[...OWRC/ow_dir/goto_reen]`
 * assignments of `Overworld_init_data_2.gml:90-2770` are carried by the `scene_data` cache
 * (`RoomData_Create`), so they are not repeated here.
 */
// biome-ignore-all lint/suspicious/noExplicitAny: ported GML state

