/**
 * `Rando_generate(quest num, seed)` — the orchestrator.
 *
 * Every pass re-anchors the PRNG with `random_set_seed(Rando_SEED)` (GML `:415,564,614,728,918,1341`) so a
 * pass is reproducible on its own and toggling one option cannot shift the numbers another option draws.
 * The passes, in ZALiA's order: quest puzzles + location table → overworld biomes → scenes → dungeon
 * tilesets → palettes → enemies → level costs → XP → town locations → dungeon rooms (empty) → dungeon
 * locations → dungeon bosses → skill locations (empty) → spell costs → spell locations → item locations
 * (+ hints).
 *
 * Dropped as dead code (PORTING.md rule 8): the `/* *​/` blocks at `:35-39`, `:100-136` (an old spell-cost
 * clamp), `:192-233` (the `g` spell tables, duplicated from `g_Create`), `:386-403`, `:764-769`, `:784-789`,
 * and the `if (0&&DEBUG)` level-cost/XP dumps. `ds_*_destroy` teardown at the end is garbage collection here.
 */
