  /*
dg_map_edge values:
$FF: Draw nothing
$FE: Draw solid
$0F bits:
  $00-03 back-end 2 pixels transparent for edge of map
  $00: Sprite 1
  $01: Sprite 1 rot 90deg
  $02: Sprite 2
  $03: Sprite 2 rot 90deg

  $04-07 same as 0-3 except back-end 2 pixels opaque for inner map
  $04: Sprite 1
  $05: Sprite 1 rot 90deg
  $06: Sprite 2
  $07: Sprite 2 rot 90deg
$C0 bits:
  $40: Flip hor
  $80: Flip ver
*/
