/**
 * Magnot (`MagnA`) — the spiked eye that slides along walls when Link crosses its trigger box. Ported from
 * `Magnot_init2/update/udp/draw.gml`. `SpikeTrap_out_of_bounds` / `GO_draw_trig_hb_1` (spike_trap scripts)
 * are local copies here until that folder lands.
 */
