/**
 * Ported from ZALiA `scene_enter_add_tiles.gml` (the Tiled → room tile loader) and `get_scene_ts_data.gml`.
 *
 * Layer-name DSL (comma/space separated tokens in a Tiled tile layer's name):
 *   `BG0703` / `FG0603`   depth name (BG/FG + 01..08) + 2-digit bg palette number
 *   `PERMUT_02` (v<4) / `PERMUT_RWBGYMKC` (v4)   palette colour permutation
 *   `SOLIDS`, `HIDDEN_01`, `BREAK__01..04`, `LIQUID_01..03 DIR_0x SPEED_xx`, `CLOUDS_01`, `SPIKE01`,
 *   `CHAIN01`, `BURNABLE_01/02`, `CURRENT_01/02`, `VISIBLE_00`, `tile_data_system_v.NN`
 *
 * Deviations (logged in FIDELITY_NOTES): tileset names come from the normalised Tiled `name` field (the GML
 * parsed the `.tsx` path); a tileset missing from `g.dm_tileset` but present in the asset manifest is used as
 * is (the GML silently drew the tile-marker tileset); `DEV` timing dropped; `_dl_rm_depth` (never filled in
 * the GML) dropped.
 */
