/**
 * Seams and GM shims for the gui port: scripts owned by other folders (player, dev tools, adapter) and GM
 * builtins the menus use. Defaults are the smallest faithful behaviour; owners replace them via `setGuiDeps`.
 */
// biome-ignore-all lint/suspicious/noExplicitAny: GML-typed seams

