/**
 * `draw` IDE folder. The sprite/text/rect primitives (`draw_sprite_`, `draw_text_`, `draw_text_plus`,
 * `draw_rect_`, `draw_spr_aligned`, `draw_background_part_ext`) were ported with the screens in
 * `rooms/draw.ts` and are re-exported here; the rest of the folder is ported below.
 * New DrawCmd kinds this module emits (adapter must render them): `spritePart` (a sub-rectangle of a
 * sprite frame), `circle`, `line`, `point` (see `rooms/draw.ts` for `tile`).
 */
