/**
 * Ported from ZALiA `tile_data_init.gml` (+ `tile_data_init_1.gml`): the static tile tables on `g.dm_tile`
 * (hidden-tile rules, the break/crumble tile-animation frame sequences), `g.dm_TILE_ANIM` (animated
 * tilesets) and the `global.WallStyle01_dm` / `WallStyle02_dm` wall-part tables.
 *
 * Deviation: ZALiA stores each animation frame as a `json_encode`d ds_map string and `json_decode`s it in
 * `tile_anim_change_frame`; here the frame is kept as a plain object with the same datakeys (no encode/decode
 * round trip). Large commented-out alternatives in the GML (`_CRUMBLE_FLOOR_REGEN_VER` 1 branch, older
 * WallStyle tables) were dropped.
 */
